Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.89,Cap,,0,0,0,,I woke up in the dark,\Nand something
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.91,0:00:05.77,Cap,,0,0,0,,was breathing right\Nover my bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.79,0:00:07.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,I looked up, and two\Nblack
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.78,0:00:09.89,Cap,,0,0,0,,holes stared back at\Nme.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.91,0:00:11.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,A blue mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.16,0:00:12.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,A black hoodie.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.36,0:00:14.21,Cap,,0,0,0,,No nose, no mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.23,0:00:15.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,And black liquid\Ndripping
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:17.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,from its empty eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.86,0:00:19.71,Cap,,0,0,0,,And this was not the\Nfirst
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.73,0:00:21.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,time it had come for\Nme.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.76,0:00:23.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,So what did it want?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.36,0:00:25.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,Let us go back to the\Nbeginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.58,0:00:27.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,My name is Mitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.18,0:00:29.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,After the bank took\Nour house, I
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.66,0:00:32.41,Cap,,0,0,0,,moved in with my\Nbrother, Edwin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.43,0:00:35.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,We had not seen each\Nother for ten years,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.44,0:00:38.81,Cap,,0,0,0,,and for one week,\Neverything was normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.83,0:00:41.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then, one night at one\Nin the morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.94,0:00:44.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,I heard rustling\Noutside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.28,0:00:46.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,I thought it was a\Nraccoon,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.40,0:00:48.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,and Edwin agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.18,0:00:51.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,The next night, I\Nheard my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.12,0:00:53.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,open, and a loud\Nthump, as if
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.70,0:00:56.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,something had climbed\Ninside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.58,0:00:58.79,Cap,,0,0,0,,I sat up and looked\Naround.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.81,0:01:00.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,There was nothing\Nthere.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.46,0:01:03.07,Cap,,0,0,0,,In the morning, Edwin\Ndropped his
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.09,0:01:05.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,coffee cup the moment\Nhe saw me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.94,0:01:08.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,He held up a mirror,\Nand I saw
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.40,0:01:11.04,Cap,,0,0,0,,a deep cut across my\Ncheek.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.06,0:01:13.23,Cap,,0,0,0,,At the hospital, the\Ndoctor said
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.25,0:01:15.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,I must have been\Nsleepwalking.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.60,0:01:17.31,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then he showed me a\Nneat,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.33,0:01:19.35,Cap,,0,0,0,,stitched line on my\Nside.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.37,0:01:21.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,I had lost my left\Nkidney,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:23.57,Cap,,0,0,0,,and nobody knew how.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.59,0:01:26.49,Cap,,0,0,0,,The next night was my\Nbreaking point.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.51,0:01:30.03,Cap,,0,0,0,,Around midnight, I\Nwoke up, and I froze.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.05,0:01:32.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,A creature was staring\Ndown
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.12,0:01:34.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,at me, face to face.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.10,0:01:36.57,Cap,,0,0,0,,It had a black hoodie,\Na dark
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.59,0:01:38.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,blue mask, and no\Neyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.86,0:01:40.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,There were only empty\Nblack
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.88,0:01:42.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,sockets, dripping.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.68,0:01:45.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,I grabbed my camera\Nand took a picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.72,0:01:48.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,It lunged at me,\Nreaching for
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.10,0:01:50.35,Cap,,0,0,0,,my chest with its\Nclaws.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.37,0:01:53.13,Cap,,0,0,0,,I kicked it in the\Nface, grabbed my
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.15,0:01:56.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,wallet, and ran out\Ninto the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.38,0:01:58.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,I ran into the woods\Nnear the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.66,0:02:00.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,house, I tripped on a\Nrock,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.78,0:02:03.25,Cap,,0,0,0,,and everything went\Nblack.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.27,0:02:05.29,Cap,,0,0,0,,I woke up in the\Nhospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.31,0:02:08.15,Cap,,0,0,0,,The doctor said my\Ninjuries were small,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.17,0:02:10.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,and my parents were\Ncoming.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.44,0:02:12.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then he told me that\Nmy brother
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.52,0:02:14.89,Cap,,0,0,0,,had been killed by\Nsomething.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.91,0:02:17.07,Cap,,0,0,0,,My parents drove me\Nback to the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.09,0:02:19.27,Cap,,0,0,0,,house to collect my\Nthings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.29,0:02:21.83,Cap,,0,0,0,,In the hallway, I saw\Nmy brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.85,0:02:24.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,and I could not look\Nfor long.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.48,0:02:27.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,Next to him lay\Nsomething small.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.26,0:02:29.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,I picked it up, and I\Nwalked to
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.66,0:02:32.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,my parents' car\Nwithout a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.36,0:02:34.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,When I looked at what\NI was
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.20,0:02:36.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,holding, I nearly\Nthrew up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.34,0:02:39.73,Cap,,0,0,0,,It was the part of me\Nthat the creature had
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.75,0:02:43.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,stolen, black with\Nthat same dark liquid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.46,0:02:47.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,This story is inspired\Nby the Eyeless Jack
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.92,0:02:52.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,creepypasta, first\Nposted by Azelf5000.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.52,0:02:54.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,Would you have stayed\Nin that
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.34,0:02:55.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,house a second night?
